{"id":"wb-7-704","name":"镇岗塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"镇岗塔","text":"镇岗塔，位于中国北京市丰台区长辛店镇，是一座砖砌实心花塔。该塔始建年代不详，据风格推测应为金朝时期建筑。该塔曾于明代修葺，抗日战争时期曾被损毁。1957年，镇岗塔被列为北京市文物保护单位。2013年，镇岗塔被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%95%87%E5%B2%97%E5%A1%94","revisionId":89970536,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89970536","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0ece23568b6d33cd4cdf24ed.jpg","title":"镇岗塔.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%95%87%E5%B2%97%E5%A1%94.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/%E9%95%87%E5%B2%97%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"霧島聖","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​镇岗塔近照","width":320,"height":432}}